# Application materials (local only).
# This repository is public and nginx serves everything tracked under files/
# as is, so nothing with a phone number or other people's contact details is
# tracked: no cover letters, no references, no tailored copies.
# Tracked sources are files/{cv,resume}_tex/reddy_{cv,resume}.{tex,sty,pdf};
# served downloads are the flat copies files/reddy_{cv,resume}.pdf.
files/private_contact.tex
files/cover_tex/
files/reddy_cover.pdf
files/Linkedin Export.pdf
files/resume_tex/reddy_resume_*.tex
files/resume_tex/reddy_resume_*.pdf
files/resume_tex/reddy_resume_*.png
files/resume_tex/reddy_resume.docx
files/resume_tex/rory_*
files/cv_tex/reddy_cv_*.tex
files/cv_tex/reddy_cv_*.pdf
files/reddy_resume_deprecated.pdf
files/Resume*.md
images/linkedin/
